        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: model-registry.service.js. Import and review are separate requests. APPROVE/RETIRE are alternative review actions. Independent importer/reviewer separation is a process gate; reviewReference text alone does not prove it and the API does not enforce different actors. Runtime fallback does not mutate money, eligibility or assignment." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
